Description: System monitor and maintenance tool for Ubuntu-based Linux
 Maintainer is a modern, lightweight native desktop application for
 monitoring, maintaining, diagnosing, and understanding Ubuntu-based
 Linux computers.
 .
 It provides one calm place to understand CPU, memory, storage,
 temperature, network, and process activity; find large and duplicate
 files; review and perform safe cleanup; inspect available system
 updates; diagnose failed services; inspect SMART storage health;
 and generate privacy-conscious local system reports.
 .
 The GUI always runs unprivileged. No permanent daemon. No telemetry.
